    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JJDK6JD1THS14YQB98VQ9APF\"><span>You will learn</span></h2>\n<p><span>Learn how to find third-party apps, which are apps built by third parties (instead of by Klaviyo) using Klaviyo's APIs. Klaviyo's APIs enable a large variety of third-parties to build apps and integrations with our platform. You can search for both Klaviyo-built integrations and select third-party apps in our <a href=\"https://marketplace.klaviyo.com/en-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">app marketplace</a>. If you are looking for an app you can't find on our marketplace, we recommend reaching out to the platform directly.</span></p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JJDK6JD157MGNG65GX78FNM6\">Find a third-party app</h2>\n<p>To find a third party app:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>In Klaviyo, select the <strong>Integrations</strong> tab.</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Explore apps</strong>.</li>\n<li>You'll be brought to our app marketplace where you can browse and search for apps.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/39451226896539\">\n</li>\n<li>Select an app to learn more about it. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/39451202479003\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01K1BA9J2QFQJ4NMS0S0R6VE7N\">Where to find help resources</h2>\n<p>All Klaviyo-built (or \"native\") integrations have help documentation on our Help Center, while third-party apps do not. You can find integration guides for Klaviyo-built integrations in the <a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/categories/115000032731-Ecommerce-Integrations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Integrations section</a>. For third-party apps, documentation is linked on the individual app's page in our marketplace under <em>Help resources</em>. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JJDK6JD242R10EHQFQYNTFZS\" class=\"wysiwyg-text-align-left\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://marketplace.klaviyo.com/en-us/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Klaviyo app marketplace</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developers.klaviyo.com/en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Klaviyo developer portal</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
